Hi Everyone,

I'd like to call a vote on
https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1032%3A+Upgrade+to+Jakarta+and+JavaEE+10+in+Kafka+4.0

This KIP upgrades to the latest Jakarta API and newest version of Jetty 12
and removes the deprecated javax APIs. It also bumps the required version
of Connect to JDK 17+ which is in line with the broker for version 4.0

Thanks,
Chris

